      "widgets_values": [
        "# Stable Yogi — Krea 2 Extended\n\nMore range, richer light, and the first build where CFG and a negative prompt work.\n\n### One switch runs the whole thing\nThe blue **INPUT** box picks what you are doing:\n\n- **1** = text to image. Type a prompt, press Run.\n- **2** = image to image. Load your own picture, press Run.\n\nThe half you did not pick never runs, so nothing is wasted.\n\n### Three files, three folders\n- the model -> `ComfyUI\\models\\diffusion_models\\`\n- the text encoder -> `ComfyUI\\models\\text_encoders\\`\n- the VAE -> `ComfyUI\\models\\vae\\`\n\nOne node pack, from ComfyUI Manager: **ComfyUI Impact Pack**. It is the switch.\n\nMore workflows, free: **stableyogi.com**"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
